{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/8824c4ccc8a866ad03963591f07b2e80.avif?t=1767177591\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Brave Knight and a Sassy, Magical Cat\u2014What Kind of Chaos Will Unfold on Their Adventure?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blade of Wiz \u2013 A Top-Down Roguelike Action Game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Blade of Wiz</i>, join forces with your feline companion to battle fierce enemies! Don\u2019t worry if you fail\u2014after all, the cat has nine lives! With each cycle, it\u2019s not just your combat skills that grow stronger, but the bond between you and your magical cat as well\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/0f43cd57cc47bf9880df252af3d2da37.poster.avif?t=1767177591\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/0f43cd57cc47bf9880df252af3d2da37.webm?t=1767177591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/0f43cd57cc47bf9880df252af3d2da37.mp4?t=1767177591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare for Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up at the camp before each fight! Unlock powerful combo skills with your black cat for seamless teamwork. Other camp features will unlock as you explore further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raw strength isn\u2019t enough. Combine elements like fire, ice, and lightning for powerful attacks. With over 40 sigils to customize your style, the possibilities are endless. Get creative and conquer the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/cbfc7fe24e8263631704e88e6e239be7.poster.avif?t=1767177591\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/cbfc7fe24e8263631704e88e6e239be7.webm?t=1767177591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/cbfc7fe24e8263631704e88e6e239be7.mp4?t=1767177591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Venture into the Imperial Castle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your route carefully\u2014each event on the map offers unique opportunities, from mysterious merchants to high-risk, high-reward challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time matters too! As day turns to night, enemies grow deadlier, and harsher effects take hold. Will you rush ahead or carefully plan your route?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/9ef6121c7b0058c976619f213acd11c6.poster.avif?t=1767177591\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/9ef6121c7b0058c976619f213acd11c6.webm?t=1767177591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/9ef6121c7b0058c976619f213acd11c6.mp4?t=1767177591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ hours of gameplay, packed with action and adventure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 epic chapters, each with 10+ levels to conquer\u2014every door hides a new mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into various side quests that reveal the secrets of this ancient castle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental magic at your fingertips\u2014fire, ice, lightning, and more\u2014create stunning combos in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ emblems to discover, letting you build a playstyle that\u2019s all your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Join the adventure and give your cat a helping paw! (&gt;^\u03c9^</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3125540?t=1767177591","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767177591","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/f171107173bd6be00cd85acd5399d7991a1d0c68/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767177591","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/f171107173bd6be00cd85acd5399d7991a1d0c68/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767177591","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/8824c4ccc8a866ad03963591f07b2e80.avif?t=1767177591\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Brave Knight and a Sassy, Magical Cat\u2014What Kind of Chaos Will Unfold on Their Adventure?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blade of Wiz \u2013 A Top-Down Roguelike Action Game!</strong></h2><p cl